# Design System — Rolê Moto PWA

Fonte: projeto **Rolê Moto PWA** no Google Stitch (`projects/10654779954297320241`).
Mobile-first, dark mode, estética cockpit/moto.

## Cores

### Paleta Principal
| Token | Hex | Uso |
|---|---|---|
| primary-container | `#FF6B00` | Botões primários, beacons, waypoints |
| primary | `#FFB693` | Tints, links, surface-tint |
| secondary-container | `#FEB300` | Warnings, badges moderado |
| tertiary-container | `#00A8BB` | Telemetria, GPS, intercom |
| surface | `#121316` | Background canvas |
| on-surface | `#E3E2E6` | Texto principal |

### Elevação (Tonal Stacking)
- **Layer 0 (Canvas):** `#121316`
- **Layer 1 (Cards):** `#1A1C20` + `1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)`
- **Layer 2 (Overlays):** `#22252B` + `1px solid rgba(255,107,0,0.22)`
- **Accent Glow:** `box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(255,107,0,0.28)`

### Badges de Ritmo (Pace)
- **Agressiva:** `#FF334B` bg `rgba(255,51,75,0.15)`, border e texto `#FF334B`
- **Moderada:** `#FFB300` bg `rgba(255,179,0,0.15)`, border e texto `#FFB300`
- **Tranquila:** `#00E676` bg `rgba(0,230,118,0.15)`, border e texto `#00E676`

## Tipografia

| Papel | Família | Uso |
|---|---|---|
| Headlines / Display | **Barlow Condensed** | Títulos, badges, telemetria |
| Body | **Plus Jakarta Sans** | Texto corrido, descrições |
| Labels | **Barlow Condensed** | Labels uppercase, chips |

### Escala
| Token | Família | Tamanho | Peso | Altura |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| display-hero | Barlow Condensed | 48px | 800 | 52px |
| display-hero-mobile | Barlow Condensed | 36px | 800 | 40px |
| headline-lg | Barlow Condensed | 32px | 700 | 36px |
| headline-md | Barlow Condensed | 24px | 700 | 28px |
| headline-sm | Barlow Condensed | 20px | 600 | 24px |
| body-lg | Plus Jakarta Sans | 16px | 500 | 24px |
| body-md | Plus Jakarta Sans | 14px | 400 | 20px |
| body-sm | Plus Jakarta Sans | 12px | 400 | 16px |
| telemetry-num | Barlow Condensed | 28px | 800 | 28px |
| badge-label | Barlow Condensed | 12px | 700 | 12px |
| label-md | Plus Jakarta Sans | 12px | 600 | 16px |

## Espaçamento

- Grid base: **8px** com micro-steps de 4px
- Gutter mobile: `16px`
- Max content width: `560px` (centrado em telas maiores)
- Touch target mínimo: `48×48px`, primário: `56px`
- Card padding: sm `12px`, md `16px`, lg `20px`

## Shapes

- Cards/Módulos: `8px` (0.5rem)
- Pill badges/chips: `9999px`
- Hero actions: `12px`

## Componentes

### Botões
- **Primário:** bg `#FF6B00`, texto `#121316`, height `52px`, glow `0 4px 14px rgba(255,107,0,0.35)`, Barlow Condensed bold uppercase
- **Secundário:** transparente, border `1.5px solid #353A44`, texto `#F5F6F8`
- **Danger (SOS):** bg `#FF334B` com anel pulsante

### Cards
- bg `#1A1C20`, border `1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)`
- Header: título da rota + horário + distância + Pace Tag
- Row de telemetria com números tabulares

### Inputs
- bg `#16171B`, border `1px solid #2D323A`
- Focus: `1.5px solid #FF6B00`
- Labels flutuantes uppercase

### Chips/Filtros
- Height `32px`, pill radius, bg `#22252B`
- Inativo: label `#8E95A2`
- Ativo: border `#FF6B00`, label `#FF6B00`
